  "solution": "Given:\n\n17 ÷ 34 + 2 × 12 ÷ 6 - 5 × 3 ÷ 6\n\nConcept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/83ad200c05af7ff0a96c689e1309a38eee4e23c73e3e9636ad108a7806b6c852.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n17 ÷ 34 + 2 × 12 ÷ 6 - 5 × 3 ÷ 6\n\n⇒ 0.5 + 2 × 2 - 5 × 0.5\n\n⇒ 0.5 + 4 - 2.5\n\n⇒ 4.5 - 2.5\n\n⇒ 2\n\n**∴ The value of 17 ÷ 34 + 2 × 12 ÷ 6 - 5 × 3 ÷ 6 is 2.**",
